{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7als3e58","slide":1,"text":"10 MINUTES","textPreview":"10 MINUTES","textChars":10,"textLines":1,"bbox":[916,392,280,32]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/dmwvje","slide":1,"text":"Welcome everyone. We are Group E, and our project is a web version of RoboRally. Our goal is to keep the social, chaotic feeling of the physical board game while making it easier to start, follow and play remotely. I will focus on the product vision and the player experience, rather than the technical implementation."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/bec6n6","slide":2,"title":"SYS::RR-02162","textShapes":14}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/yd8rix4n","slide":2,"text":"SYS::RR-02162","textPreview":"SYS::RR-02162","textChars":13,"textLines":1,"bbox":[56,28,280,26]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/50zadc3e","slide":2,"text":"02","textPreview":"02","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1168,28,56,26]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/kzq9k7mt","slide":2,"bbox":[56,61,1168,0.01]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bax8725w","slide":2,"text":"Why a digital RoboRally?","textPreview":"Why a digital RoboRally?","textChars":24,"textLines":1,"bbox":[56,78,1168,64]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/a9orex4r","slide":2,"text":"The physical game is difficult to start spontaneously.","textPreview":"The physical game is difficult to start spontaneously.","textChars":54,"textLines":1,"bbox":[56,154,760,116]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/xczq9cn2","slide":2,"bbox":[56,294,1168,0.01]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wbq9g7mh","slide":2,"text":"01","textPreview":"01","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[56,330,48,36]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/n6x83i50","slide":2,"text":"Same room","textPreview":"Same room","textChars":9,"textLines":1,"bbox":[114,327,292,38]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/m5orad4f","slide":2,"text":"Every player needs to meet around one table.","textPreview":"Every player needs to meet around one table.","textChars":44,"textLines":1,"bbox":[114,369,292,72]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8r690rex","slide":2,"text":"02","textPreview":"02","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[438,330,48,36]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9sfq9wvi","slide":2,"text":"Manual bookkeeping","textPreview":"Manual bookkeeping","textChars":18,"textLines":1,"bbox":[496,327,292,38]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/mporyhw7","slide":2,"text":"Cards, checkpoints, damage and turn order need constant tracking.","textPreview":"Cards, checkpoints, damage and turn order need constant tracking.","textChars":65,"textLines":1,"bbox":[496,369,292,72]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7qx87mdc","slide":2,"text":"03","textPreview":"03","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[820,330,48,36]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/knm9w7e1","slide":2,"text":"Rule ambiguity","textPreview":"Rule ambiguity","textChars":14,"textLines":1,"bbox":[878,327,302,38]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lofq5cfm","slide":2,"text":"One resolution mistake can interrupt the whole round.","textPreview":"One resolution mistake can interrupt the whole round.","textChars":53,"textLines":1,"bbox":[878,369,302,72]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/y14ruhwv","slide":2,"text":"The friction comes before the fun starts.","textPreview":"The friction comes before the fun starts.","textChars":41,"textLines":1,"bbox":[56,590,1168,54]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/bec6n6","slide":2,"text":"The main problem is not the game itself. The problem is the friction around it. Everyone must be in the same place, setup takes time, and players must manually track cards, checkpoints, damage and exact execution order. A small mistake can interrupt the round and create an argument about the correct state."}
