{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/nad8rixg","slide":3,"text":"Movement and hazards resolve consistently","textPreview":"Movement and hazards resolve consistently","textChars":41,"textLines":1,"bbox":[644,390,238,110]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/2947ydgv","slide":3,"bbox":[938,314,238,0.01]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/pcfqtsfm","slide":3,"text":"BOARD-GAME FEEL","textPreview":"BOARD-GAME FEEL","textChars":15,"textLines":1,"bbox":[938,336,238,38]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ob6p0ny1","slide":3,"text":"Robots remain tactile and readable","textPreview":"Robots remain tactile and readable","textChars":34,"textLines":1,"bbox":[938,390,238,110]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bex8v2xs","slide":3,"text":"The product supports play. It does not replace the uncertainty that makes RoboRally fun.","textPreview":"The product supports play. It does not replace the uncertainty that makes RoboRally fun.","textChars":88,"textLines":1,"bbox":[56,574,1168,62]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/rlxpps","slide":3,"text":"Our vision is a shared 3D board that still feels like a real board game. Players join remotely and see the same game state. The software resolves movement, hazards and progress consistently. It removes administration, but it keeps the uncertainty that creates RoboRally's funniest moments."}
