{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8zi5s3md","slide":4,"text":"The board stays central. Everything around it explains what happens next.","textPreview":"The board stays central. Everything around it explains what happens next.","textChars":73,"textLines":1,"bbox":[124,622,1032,44]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/4y3px3","slide":4,"text":"The board is the shared centre of the experience. Players should immediately see every robot's position and direction. The interface then explains the current phase, public status and checkpoint progress. Action cards replace physical card handling. This lets players concentrate on planning instead of maintaining the game state."}
