{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/iiucoy","slide":7,"text":"For Release 1, we narrow the vision to one complete shared loop. Players need to see the state, choose cards privately, execute programs automatically, apply board effects and continue from a synchronized result. Robot classes, custom decks, adaptive boards and progression remain possible extensions. We should only commit to them after the core loop works well."}
