{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/u147elw3","slide":10,"text":"QUESTIONS?","textPreview":"QUESTIONS?","textChars":10,"textLines":1,"bbox":[56,584,1168,64]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/sm3tvf","slide":10,"text":"Release 1 succeeds when a complete round runs from private card selection to one synchronized result without manual rule checking. Players should understand what is happening, and the system should resolve the rules consistently. That gives us a strong foundation for every later extension. Thank you. We are ready for questions."}